"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"120318"},{"characterId":"87298","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"320098"},{"characterId":"87298","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"41747"}],"egsCharacterIds":["8364"],"vndbCharacterId":"c13964"},"originalCharacterName":"音羽 桂香","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Keika is the main heroine of Natsu Kagura and eldest daughter of Otowa sisters with a very long jet black hair. Gently mild and polite, a perfect Yamato Nadeshiko type shrine maiden, who's living at Minamori shrine. A second year student who attends school at the bottom of the mountain. Since she takes seriously whatever she's told, she often becomes subject of teasing by Youko and even sometimes by herown younger sister. Her weakness is her lack of awareness between male-female's relationship and her awkwardness for electronic equipment systems, though it seems that she's able to use the microwave oven. Despite of her modesty and gentle personality, she's shown to have an excessive sexual addiction during rape."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Keika is prominent in kenjutsu. Her weapon is Shishio (獅子王), a legendary katana that possesses massive divine spiritual power & lightning properties, which can be summoned by her at anytime."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c13964"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"温和で優しい水杜神社の長女。 礼儀正しい大和撫子タイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"長く美しい黒髪とバランスのとれたスタイルの持ち主。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"神社では一番の常識人で、天然ボケ揃いな一家のツッコミ役と化している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"麓の学園に通う二年生で、主人公より1つ下。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"物事を何でも素直に受け取るので、時々妹や居候のおもちゃにされている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"欠点は、男性に対してほとんど免疫がないのと、電子機器に対する不器用さ。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8364","sourceWorkId":"20961","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"水杜神社の長女であり、初花の姉。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"巫女としての修行に励む、温和で礼儀正しい美少女ではあるが、やや天然な部分もある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何事にも真面目で、素直に全てを受け止める性格だが、電子機器に対して絶望的に相性が悪い。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8364","sourceWorkId":"30023","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"水杜神社の長女である退魔巫女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"巫女として懸命に修行に励んでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"温和で礼儀正しい美少女であるが、やや天然な部分もある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何事にも真面目で、素直に全てを受け止める。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8364","sourceWorkId":"40479","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"水杜神社の長女であり、初花の姉。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"巫女としての修行に励む、温和で礼儀正しい美少女ではあるが、やや天然な部分もある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何事にも真面目で、素直に全てを受け止める性格だが、電子機器に対して絶望的に相性が悪い。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"87298"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/46/4612fb09532aa604edf154e4c6ef0802b18ac6ce15d8490bab563ecd0b6430c3.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5b/5bb2fa035850d06c73c130e9a7cd75bb6d995694a65b6018324d78f5d2d9d188.webp","width":208,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"宮川美保","creatorId":"vndb:s3635","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3635","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3635","name":"宮川 美保","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:320098:87298:4693:1","source":"bangumi"}]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"egs:brand:2720","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:2720","canonicalEntityId":"egs:brand:2720","name":"でぼの巣製作所","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:30023:2720","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p9483","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p9483","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p9483","name":"Shiravune","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:107301